    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322640/extras/c8e8164b2f4874a39ee1708ccf8ede6c.poster.avif?t=1701537759\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322640/extras/c8e8164b2f4874a39ee1708ccf8ede6c.webm?t=1701537759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322640/extras/c8e8164b2f4874a39ee1708ccf8ede6c.mp4?t=1701537759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The archenemy stole your queen and hid in the portal. But you managed to jump into the portal hole. Who knows, maybe is it trap?<br><br>Explore the hazard dungeon with nothing but your dash skill. Complete goals to open the all rooms. Moving room to room to find and save your queen. Use unlocked abilities to kill the monsters easier.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Many different enemies<br></li><li>Rooms with different rules<br></li><li>Only dash, only hardcore<br></li><li>Support for both controller and keyboard play</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322640/extras/c8e8164b2f4874a39ee1708ccf8ede6c.poster.avif?t=1701537759\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322640/extras/c8e8164b2f4874a39ee1708ccf8ede6c.webm?t=1701537759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2322640/extras/c8e8164b2f4874a39ee1708ccf8ede6c.mp4?t=1701537759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The archenemy stole your queen and hid in the portal. But you managed to jump into the portal hole. Who knows, maybe is it trap?<br><br>Explore the hazard dungeon with nothing but your dash skill. Complete goals to open the all rooms. Moving room to room to find and save your queen. Use unlocked abilities to kill the monsters easier.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Many different enemies<br></li><li>Rooms with different rules<br></li><li>Only dash, only hardcore<br></li><li>Support for both controller and keyboard play</li></ul>",
